silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_04_measurement_leg_concrete_anchor a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "MeasurementLegConcreteAnchorExample" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_04_measurement_leg_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'MeasurementLegConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, WeightMeas_3450g: the measurement event recording Mittens at 3450 grams; performed on 2026-05-18 at Tartu Animal Clinic; stored in VetRecord_77; distinct from Value_3450 (the pure number) and BodyMassQuality (the attribute type); also, MeasurementArrow_Weight: the typed arrow WeightMeas_3450g -> MittensColimitApex; distinct from quality_leg (BodyMassQuality -> MittensColimitApex) and value_leg (Value_3450 -> WeightMeas_3450g); also, Date_2026_05_18: the date of the measurement event; the temporal anchor that makes WeightMeas_3450g a time-indexed token of the quality BodyMassQuality." .
